Acid erupts all around your target, dealing [197, 266, 318, 363, 403 (TL1-5; SP 100)] acid damage.

The acid attack is extremely distracting, and may remove up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] physical or mental temporary effects or mental sustains (depending on the Spell Save of the target).

The damage and chance to remove effects will increase with your Spellpower.
